msgid ""
"My lords have chosen Sir Brandis Fairweather as the arbiter for the Treaty of Harmondale.  His reputation as an evenhanded referee is second to none.  On %30, Sir Fairweather presided over a tense negotiation to divide the contested lands of Harmondale and surrounds.  Though discord threatened the peace, Sir Fairweather's quick diplomacy carried the day, and a formal peace treaty was signed between Erathia and Avlee.  \n"
