# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:188
msgid ""
"Silvertongue,  My spies report there is a small group of would-be heroes traveling about the land trying to put an end to our little Plan for a New World.  They are reportedly seeking permission to visit the Oracle in Free Haven.  You must not permit this to happen--If the Guardian awakens before our plan has matured it will spell the end for both of us.  Deny them permission to visit the Oracle, even if it reveals you to be a traitor.  We need the time your delay will buy us.  Oh yeah...Praise Baa. \n"
"Zenofex"
msgstr "*"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:19
msgid ""
"The White Freezing Potion turns any normal weapon into a weapon of Frost. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of two of any red reagent type, plus two of any blue reagent type and one of the yellow reagents."
msgstr ""
"*Una Poción Blanca Helada convierte cualquier arma en un arma de Hielo. Para elaborar esta Poción necesitáis encontrar la combinación correcta de dos de los reactivos rojos, más dos de los azules y uno de los amarillos.*"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:190
msgid ""
"Jarvis,  We have determined that the Mayor of Mist is third on our list of enemies, below only Charles d’Sorpigal and Jennica Bradley.  We need you to DELICATELY gain jurisdiction to patrol Mist and the surrounding island, and then to deal with the Mayor accordingly.  If this goes smoothly, then remove Charles and Jennica as well.  Handle this job with great care and you will be rewarded.  Gerrard Blackames"
msgstr "*"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:191
msgid ""
"Damian,  Congratulations on your new assignment.  The Shadow Guild wants you to ambush caravans passing from New Sorpigal to Ironfist or Free Haven.  Under no circumstances are you to divulge that you have any connection to us, or the deal is off and you will find out what happens to those who betray us.  Do as you are told and there won’t be any problems.  Prince of Thieves"
msgstr ""
"Damian:  Enhorabuena por tu nuevo encargo.  El Gremio de las Sombras quiere que asaltes las caravanas que van de Nuevo Sorpigal a Ironfist o a Free Haven.  Bajo ninguna circunstancia debes revelar que tienes relación alguna con nosotros, o el trato se acabará y descubrirás lo que les pasa a quienes nos traicionan.  Haz lo que se te dice y no habrá ningún problema.  Príncipe de los Ladrones"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:191
msgid "Orders from the Shadow Gu"
msgstr "Órdenes del Gremio de las Sombras"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
# fan text corrected (Claude)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/scroll.txt:192
msgid ""
"My Dear Sulman, Sep 17, 1152\n"
"You have done well, and I hereby promote you to High Priest of the Second Circle.  There is a sum of gold waiting for you in the hands of Andover Potbello in New Sorpigal that he will turn over to you if you tell him the Sandman sent you and show him the Seal on this letter.  Sandman…I like that.    \n"
"The handling of the Roland affair was masterful, and I especially liked the snowstorm touch—it really put the Fear in him, didn’t it?  Superstitious fool!  His removal has moved our timetable ahead by at least two years and has spared us the trouble of assassinating him at a more delicate time.  All arrangements are in place. My minions have engineered the recall of Queen Catherine to her homeland in Erathia to attend the funeral of her father.  She will not return this year, and that only leaves her worthless brat Nicolai and that idiot Regent Wilbur Humphrey running things at the palace. \n"
"The people have begun to sense that something is wrong, that perhaps the gods are angry.  That perhaps…the Ironfists have lost the Mandate of Heaven.  Just a few more disasters and there may well be a full-scale rebellion! And we will be waiting at the breach, ready to step in and tell the sheep what to do and when to do it.  Already our temples spread across the land, offering aid to those displaced by disasters, and comfort to the bereaved...   \n"
"Yes.  Remain in New Sorpigal and stay out of sight.  When the time is right you will be contacted and given further instructions.  So take heart, and know that our plan proceeds smoothly and we will be ruling this world soon.  Your position in our hierarchy will be very high!\n"
"--Zenofex"
msgstr ""
"Mi querido Sulman, 17 de septiembre de 1152\n"
"Has hecho un buen trabajo, y por la presente te asciendo a Sumo Sacerdote del Segundo Círculo.  Hay una suma de oro esperándote en manos de Andover Potbello en Nuevo Sorpigal, que te la entregará si le dices que te envía el Hombre de Arena y le muestras el sello de esta carta.  El Hombre de Arena… me gusta.    \n"
"La gestión del asunto de Roland fue magistral, y me gustó especialmente el toque de la tormenta de nieve: de verdad le metió el Miedo en el cuerpo, ¿no es así?  ¡Necio supersticioso!  Su desaparición ha adelantado nuestro calendario al menos dos años y nos ha ahorrado la molestia de asesinarlo en un momento más delicado.  Todo está dispuesto. Mis secuaces han conseguido que la reina Catherine regrese a su tierra natal en Erathia para asistir al funeral de su padre.  No volverá este año, y eso solo deja a su inútil mocoso Nicolai y a ese idiota del regente Wilbur Humphrey al mando del palacio. \n"
"El pueblo ha empezado a intuir que algo va mal, que quizá los dioses están enfadados.  Que quizá… los Ironfist han perdido el Mandato del Cielo.  ¡Unos pocos desastres más y bien podría estallar una rebelión en toda regla! Y nosotros estaremos esperando en la brecha, listos para intervenir y decirles a las ovejas qué hacer y cuándo hacerlo.  Nuestros templos ya se extienden por todo el país, ofreciendo ayuda a los desplazados por los desastres y consuelo a los afligidos...   \n"
"Sí.  Permanece en Nuevo Sorpigal y no te dejes ver.  Cuando llegue el momento, se pondrán en contacto contigo y recibirás nuevas instrucciones.  Así que ánimo, y has de saber que nuestro plan avanza sin contratiempos y que pronto gobernaremos este mundo.  ¡Tu posición en nuestra jerarquía será muy alta!\n"
"--Zenofex"

