"Made from thornbark tree heartwood and rimmed with iron, this shield is sturdy, if a bit heavy."
msgstr ""
"Hecho con duramen de árbol de corteza espinosa y ribeteado de hierro, este escudo es resistente, aunque algo pesado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:103
msgid "Thornbark Shield"
msgstr "Escudo de Corteza Espinosa"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:104
msgid ""
"Every ten moons, the Regnans hold a great festival which includes a tournament of arms. The noble class contestants spare no expense in the commissioning of shields that are light, but tough enough to shelter them from harm."
msgstr ""
"Cada diez lunas, los regnan celebran un gran festival que incluye un torneo de armas. Los concursantes de la clase noble no reparan en gastos al encargar escudos ligeros, pero lo bastante duros para protegerlos de todo daño."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:104
msgid "Regnan Tournament Shield"
msgstr "Escudo de Torneo Regnan"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:105
msgid ""
"In the Demon Wars of Erathia, the Humans found that only erudine armor was proof against the fiery attacks of their foes. Bit by bit, pieces of this armor - like this shield - have made their way to Jadame."
msgstr ""
"En las Guerras de los Demonios de Erathia, los humanos descubrieron que solo la armadura de erudina resistía los ataques ígneos de sus enemigos. Poco a poco, piezas de esta armadura, como este escudo, han llegado hasta Jadame."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:105
msgid "Veteran Shield"
msgstr "Escudo de Veterano"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:106
msgid "Dragon Hunter's Shield"
msgstr "Escudo del Cazador de Dragones"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:106
msgid ""
"The town of Kriegspire in Enroth had a problem with Dragons. These shields were their answer. Magically bound layers of erudine, stalt-steel and hydra leather, make a nearly unbreakable material resistant to most Dragon breath weapons."
msgstr ""
"La ciudad de Kriegspire, en Enroth, tenía un problema con los dragones. Estos escudos fueron su respuesta. Capas de erudina, acero de stalt y cuero de hidra unidas mágicamente forman un material casi irrompible, resistente a la mayoría de los alientos de dragón."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:107 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:108 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:109
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:110 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:111 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1689
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1690 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1691 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1692
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1693 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:889 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:890
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:891 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:892 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:893
msgid "Small Shield"
msgstr "Escudo Pequeño"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:107
msgid ""
"This small shield is gripped in the off-weapon hand. The wielder is much dependent on agility to make use of its scant defensive coverage."
msgstr ""
"Este pequeño escudo se empuña con la mano que no sostiene el arma. Su portador depende mucho de su agilidad para aprovechar la escasa protección que ofrece."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:107
msgid "Wooden Buckler"
msgstr "Rodela de Madera"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:108
msgid ""
"Caravan guards traveling Merchant of Alvar trade routes must often cover long distances on foot. This shield, like the rest of their equipment is well made and lightweight."
msgstr ""
"Los guardias de las caravanas que recorren las rutas comerciales de los mercaderes de Alvar a menudo deben cubrir largas distancias a pie. Este escudo, como el resto de su equipo, está bien hecho y es ligero."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:108
msgid "Caravaner's Small Shield"
msgstr "Escudo Pequeño de Caravanero"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:109
msgid ""
"A favorite among mounted knights, these steel shields are strong enough to turn aside the points of pikemen."
msgstr ""
"Muy apreciados por los caballeros montados, estos escudos de acero son lo bastante fuertes para desviar las puntas de las picas."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:109
msgid "Calvary Shield"
msgstr "Escudo de Caballería"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:11
msgid "Minotaur Battlesword"
msgstr "Espada de Batalla de Minotauro"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:11
msgid ""
"Only those possessed of great strength and balance can gracefully swing these mighty blades let alone control them in the heat of combat."
msgstr ""
"Solo quienes poseen una gran fuerza y equilibrio pueden blandir con soltura estas poderosas hojas, y no digamos controlarlas en el fragor del combate."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:110
msgid "Death Head Shield"
msgstr "Escudo de la Calavera"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:110
msgid ""
"The Necromancers' Guild likes to arm its undead armies well. Their elite infantry carry these erudine alloy shield of great strength."
msgstr ""
"Al Gremio de los Nigromantes le gusta armar bien a sus ejércitos de no muertos. Su infantería de élite lleva estos escudos de aleación de erudina de gran resistencia."

