# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1766
msgid ""
"A magical herb of unusual properties.  Phirna Root can be used to make potions.  (To use, pick the herb up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr ""
"Una hierba mágica de propiedades inusuales.  La Raíz de Phirna sirve para preparar pociones.  (Para usarla, coged la hierba y haced clic derecho sobre un Frasco de Poción vacío.)"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1767
msgid ""
"A magical herb of unusual properties.  Widoweeps Berries can be used to make potions.  (To use, pick the herb up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr ""
"Una hierba mágica de propiedades inusuales.  Las Bayas Lloraviudas sirven para preparar pociones.  (Para usarla, coged la hierba y haced clic derecho sobre un Frasco de Poción vacío.)"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1767
