# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:540
msgid ""
"(Might +100, Immune to Fear, Accuracy -30, Armor Class -15) An experiment of the Blackshire Artificers' Guild, this belt was designed to turn its wearer into the perfect warrior--mighty and fearless. No more were made when in field tests it became apparent that \"foolhardy\" and \"careless\" were not virtues of the perfect warrior."
msgstr ""
"(Fuerza +100, Inmunidad al Miedo, Precisión -30, Cls.Armadura -15) Fruto de un experimento del Gremio de Artífices de Blackshire, este cinturón se diseñó para convertir a quien lo llevara en el guerrero perfecto: fuerte y sin miedo. No se fabricaron más cuando en las pruebas de campo quedó claro que \"temerario\" y \"descuidado\" no eran virtudes del guerrero perfecto."

