# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:632
msgid ""
"Quest Item: Both the keys and ring are made of a metal you've never encountered before. The gemstones inset in the key heads are familiar to you. They are elemental heartstones like those incorporated in the conflux key Xanthor made for you."
msgstr ""
"Objeto de Misión: Tanto las llaves como la argolla están hechas de un metal que nunca habíais visto. Las gemas engastadas en las cabezas de las llaves os resultan conocidas: son piedras corazón elementales como las que lleva la llave de confluencia que os hizo Xanthor."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:632
msgid "Ring of Keys"
msgstr "Llavero"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:633
msgid "Idol"
msgstr "Ídolo"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:633
msgid "Idol of the Snake"
msgstr "Ídolo de la Serpiente"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:633
msgid ""
"Quest Item: An Idol of the ancient snake god who was worshipped by the Serpentmen who used to dwell on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr ""
"Objeto de Misión: Un ídolo del antiguo dios serpiente al que adoraban los hombres serpiente que vivían antaño en las Islas de Herida de Daga."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:634
msgid "Big Brass Ring"
msgstr "Gran Aro de Latón"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:634
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A large ring of polished brass. It seems to be part of a door knocker."
msgstr ""
"Objeto de Misión: Un gran aro de latón pulido. Parece formar parte de una aldaba."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:635
msgid "Hide"
