# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3512
msgid ""
"With Grand Master Light Magic you can learn all of the Grand Master spells for this element.\n"
"Higher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\n"
"Grand Master Light Magic can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Light Magic, have completed either the Archmage or Priest of Light promotion quests and can pay the price of 8000 gold."
