msgstr "Oberic Nosewort"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1069 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4549
msgid ""
"Master Oberic Nosewort teaches students of the bow in his home in Ravenshore.\n"
"If you seek Mastery of this weapon you must seek him out there."
msgstr ""
"El Maestro Oberic Nosewort enseña a los alumnos del Arco en su hogar de Ravenshore.\n"
"Si queréis alcanzar la Maestría con esta arma, debéis buscarlo allí."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:131 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:438 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4553
msgid "Solis"
msgstr "Solis"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1071 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4554
msgid ""
"Solis, Grand Master of the Bow, lives in the Dark Elf city of Alvar.\n"
"She can teach you Grand Mastery of the Bow."
msgstr ""
"Solis, Gran Maestra con el Arco, vive en la ciudad de elfos oscuros de Alvar. Ella puede enseñaros la Gran Maestría con el arco."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:132 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:439 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4558
msgid "Lisha Sourbrow"
msgstr "Lisha Sourbrow"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1073 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4559
msgid ""
"Lisha Sourbrow teaches Expert uses of the Mace from her home in Ravenshore."
msgstr ""
"Lisha Sourbrow enseña el uso Experto de la Maza en su casa de Ravenshore."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:133 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:440 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4563
msgid "Robert Morningstar"
msgstr "Robert Morningstar"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1074 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4564
msgid ""
"Robert Morningstar, teaches Mastery of the Mace to the knights in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr ""
"Robert Morningstar enseña la Maestría con la Maza a los caballeros de Garrote Gorge."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:134 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:441 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4568
msgid "Brother Hearthsworn"
msgstr "Hermano Hearthsworn"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1075 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4569
msgid ""
"Brother Hearthsworn, the Grand Master of the Mace, retired to the peace of the Ironsand Desert, seeking tranquility among the dunes of that region.\n"
"His home is in the village of Rust."
msgstr ""
"El hermano Hearthsworn, el Gran Maestro de la Maza, se retiró a la paz del Desierto de Arena de Hierro, en busca de la tranquilidad entre las dunas de la región. Su hogar está en la aldea de Herrumbre."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:144 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:442 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4573
msgid "Qillain Moore"
msgstr "Qillain Moore"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1077 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4574
msgid ""
"Qillain Moore used to serve the knight, Charles Quixote, but disagreed with his crusade to slay all the Dragons in the Garrote Gorge area. Moore still teaches Expert uses of the Shield from his home in the city of Alvar."
msgstr ""
"Qillain Moore servía al caballero Charles Quijote en otro tiempo, pero no aprobaba su cruzada para matar a todos los dragones de Garrote Gorge. Moore sigue enseñando las artes de Experto con el Escudo en su hogar de la ciudad de Alvar."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:145 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:443 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4578
msgid "Sheldon Nightwood"
msgstr "Sheldon Nightwood"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1078 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4579
msgid ""
"Sheldon Nightwood lives in the city of Twilight, beneath the Necromancers' Guild on the Shadowspire.\n"
"She can teach you Mastery of the Shield."
msgstr ""
"Sheldon Nightwood vive en la ciudad de Crepúsculo, con el Gremio de los nigromantes de Shadowspire. Ella puede enseñaros la Maestría con el Escudo."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:146 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:444 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4583
msgid "Peryn Reaverston"
msgstr "Peryn Reaverston"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1080 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4584
msgid ""
"The knight, Peryn Reaverston, holds the title of Grand Master of the Shield.\n"
"He is currently in service to Charles Quixote and teaches knights in the proper uses of the shield.\n"
"Search him out in the Dragon Hunter's Camp in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr ""
"El caballero Peryn Reaverston, tiene el título de Gran Maestro con el Escudo. Ahora sirve a las órdenes de Charles Quijote y enseña a los caballeros el uso correcto del Escudo. Buscadlo en el campamento de cazadragones de Garrote Gorge."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:135 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:445 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4588
msgid "Thadin"
msgstr "Thadin"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1083 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4589
msgid ""
"The Lizardman Thadin is the Expert instructor of the use of Leather armor.\n"
"His instruction will give you an Expert skill level with this armor.\n"
"You can find him on the Island of Dagger Wound."
msgstr ""
"El hombre-lagarto Thadin es el instructor Experto en el uso de la Armadura de Cuero.\n"
"Sus enseñanzas os darán un nivel de habilidad de Experto con esta armadura.\n"
"Podéis encontrarlo en las Islas de Herida de Daga."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:136 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:446 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4593
msgid "Shamus Hollyfield"
msgstr "Shamus Hollyfield"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1086 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4594
msgid ""
"Master Shamus Hollyfield dwells in the Minotaur city, Balthazar Lair, which is located in the Ravage Roaming region.\n"
"He can teach you Mastery of Leather armor."
msgstr ""
"El Maestro Shamus Hollyfield reside en la ciudad de los minotauros, en la Guarida de Baltasar, que se encuentra en la región de Ronda Siniestra. Puede enseñaros la Maestría con la Armadura de Cuero."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:137 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:447 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4598
msgid "Medwari Elmsmire"
msgstr "Medwari Elmsmire"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1088 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4599
msgid ""
"Medwari Elmsmire makes the finest Leather armor in the realm.\n"
"She also holds the title of Grand Master of Leather Armor and can instruct you at her home in the village of Rust in the Ironsand Desert."
msgstr ""
"Medwari Elmsmire hace la mejor Armadura de Cuero del reino.\n"
"También ostenta el título de Gran Maestra en Armadura de Cuero y puede enseñaros en su casa del pueblo de Herrumbre, en el Desierto de Arena de Hierro."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:138 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:448 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4603
msgid "Tobren Forgewright"
msgstr "Tobren Forgewright"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1090 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4604
msgid ""
"Tobren Forgewright assisted the city of Ravenshore in the First Pirate War.\n"
"Her forge glowed for four weeks straight as she made chain armor for the defenders of Ravenshore.\n"
"She still teaches Expert use of the armor from her home in the seaside port of Ravenshore."
msgstr ""
"Tobren Forgewright ayudó a la ciudad de Ravenshore en la Primera Guerra Pirata.\n"
"Su fragua estuvo encendida cuatro semanas seguidas mientras hacía Armaduras de Cota para los defensores de Ravenshore.\n"
"Sigue enseñando el uso Experto de esta armadura en su casa del puerto de Ravenshore."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:139 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:449 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4608
msgid "Halian Eversmyle"
msgstr "Halian Eversmyle"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1093 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4609
msgid ""
"Halian Eversmyle learned all the skills he could from the Grand Master of Chain armor and then fled to the city of Alvar where he teaches Mastery of this armor to the Merchants of Alvar.\n"
"He will instruct you to Mastery as well."
msgstr ""
"Halian Eversmyle aprendió todo lo que pudo del Gran Maestro en Armadura de Cota y luego partió a la ciudad de Alvar, donde enseña la Maestría en esta armadura a los mercaderes de Alvar.\n"
"También os instruirá a vosotros en la Maestría."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:140 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:450 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4613
msgid "Seline Burnkindle"
msgstr "Seline Burnkindle"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1095 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4614
msgid ""
"Grand Master Seline Burnkindle teaches ways of using chain armor to its greatest advantage.\n"
"She lives among the Pirates of Regna."
msgstr ""
"La Gran Maestra Seline Burnkindle enseña a sacar el mayor provecho de la Armadura de Cota.\n"
"Vive con los Piratas de Regna."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1432 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2088 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:640
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:141 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:451 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4618
msgid "Bone"
msgstr "Hueso"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1097 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4619
msgid ""
"Bone teaches the Expert skills of Plate armor from his hut on Dagger Wound Island."
msgstr ""
"Bone enseña la habilidad de Experto con la Armadura de Placas en su cabaña de las Islas de Herida de Daga."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:142 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:452 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4623
msgid "Botham"
msgstr "Botham"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1098 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4624
msgid ""
"Master Botham was one of the finest warriors in the First Pirate War.\n"
"Ravenshore owes him a debt of gratitude.\n"
"Botham and his fellow swordsman led the charge against the first wave of Regnans.\n"
"Their Plate armor deflected all but the most serious blows.\n"
"He still teaches Mastery of Plate armor from his home."
msgstr ""
"El Maestro Botham fue uno de los mejores guerreros de la Primera Guerra Pirata.\n"
"Ravenshore le está muy agradecida.\n"
"Botham y sus compañeros espadachines dirigieron la carga contra la primera oleada de regnan.\n"
"Sus Armaduras de Placas desviaron todos los golpes salvo los más graves.\n"
"Sigue enseñando la Maestría en Armadura de Placas en su casa."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:453 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4628
msgid "Seth Ironfist"
msgstr "Seth Ironfist"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1103 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4629
msgid ""
"Seth Ironfist, Grand Master of Plate Armor, is the true force behind Charles Quixote's crusade against the Dragons of Garrote Gorge.\n"
"Without his instruction in the use of Plate armor, Quixote's knights would be mere fodder before the wrath Redreaver's Dragons."
msgstr ""
"Seth Ironfist, Gran Maestro con la Armadura de Placas, es el verdadero impulsor de la cruzada de Charles Quijote contra los dragones de Garrote Gorge. Sin sus enseñanzas en el uso de la Armadura de Placas, los caballeros de Quijote no tendrían nada que hacer ante la ira de los dragones Redreaver."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:147 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:454 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4633
msgid "Taren Temper"
msgstr "Taren Temper"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1105 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4634
msgid ""
"Taren Temper, fled Erathia to make a new life for himself among those who know nothing of the Temper history.\n"
"He teaches Expert skills in Fire Magic from his home in Ravenshore."
msgstr ""
"Taren Temper salió de Erathia para vivir una nueva vida entre los que no sabían nada de la historia de Temper. Enseña habilidad de Experto de Magia del Fuego en su casa de Ravenshore."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:148 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:455 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4638
msgid "Solomon Steele"
msgstr "Solomon Steele"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1107 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4639
msgid ""
"Solomon Steele, Master of Fire, lives in the tranquil city of Alvar.\n"
"He can teach you Mastery of Fire Magic."
msgstr ""
"Solomon Steele, Maestro de Fuego, vive en la tranquila ciudad de Alvar. Puede enseñaros la Maestría con la Magia del Fuego."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:149 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:456 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4643
msgid "Burn"
msgstr "Burn"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4644
msgid ""
"Burn, Grand Master of Fire dwells in the oppressive heat of the Plane of Fire.\n"
"Perhaps the Gate of Fire that has appeared in the Ironsand Desert will lead you to him.\n"
"He can instruct you in Grand Mastery of Fire Magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Burn, Gran Maestro del Fuego, habita en el calor asfixiante del Plano del Fuego.\n"
"Quizá el Portal de Fuego que ha aparecido en el Desierto de Arena de Hierro os lleve hasta él.\n"
"Puede instruiros en la Gran Maestría en Magia del Fuego.\n"

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:153 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:457 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4648
msgid "Reshie"
msgstr "Reshie"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:129 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1113 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4649
msgid ""
"Reshie teaches the Expert skill of Air Magic from his home on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr ""
"Reshie enseña la Magia del Aire para Expertos en su casa de las Islas de Herida de Daga"

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:154 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:458 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4653
msgid "Hollis Stormeye"
msgstr "Hollis Stormeye"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4654
msgid ""
"Hollis Stormeye, Master of Air, made her home in Balthazar Lair, home of the Minotaurs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hollis Stormeye, Maestra en Magia del Aire, se fue a vivir a la Guarida de Baltasar, hogar de los minotauros.\n"

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:155 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:459 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4658
msgid "Cloud Nedlon"
msgstr "Cloud Nedlon"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1116 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4659
msgid ""
"Cloud Nedlon sought to make a deal with the Lords of Air.\n"
"He left to find a way into the Plane of Air, where he thought he would learn all that remained unclear to him about the ways of Air Magic.\n"
"You will have to travel to the Plane of Air to see if he was successful."
msgstr ""
"Cloud Nedlon buscó un pacto con los Señores del Aire. Partió para buscar un camino al Plano del Aire, donde pensó que aprendería todo lo que le quedaba por aprender sobre las artes de la Magia del Aire. Tendréis que viajar al Plano del Aire para intentar conseguirlo."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:152 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:466
msgid ""
"All of this upheaval is seriously impacting our guild's business. I need more information, but I'm being buried in gossip and rumor.Many tell me of this sea of fire in the Ironsand Desert. I've heard the tale enough that I almost believe it. Confirmation or denial of the lake's existence would be of great help to me.If you would serve me, go to the Ironsand Desert and seek this lake. If it is indeed there, find me someone who saw it appear. Bring him back here so I can hear his story myself."
msgstr ""
"Toda esta convulsión está afectando gravemente al negocio de nuestro gremio. Necesito más información, pero me estoy viendo abrumado por habladurías y rumores."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:150 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:460 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4663
msgid "Ulbrecht Pederton"
msgstr "Ulbrecht Pederton"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1119 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4664
msgid ""
"Ulbrecht Pederton single handedly stopped the Second Pirate War.\n"
"He charged down the beach to come to Ravenshore's defense as the pirates began to land.\n"
"He manipulated the sea itself and forced the Regnan fleet back into the ocean.\n"
"Unfortunately this effort cost him the ability to use magic altogether.\n"
"He still, however, teaches the knowledge of Expert Water Magic.\n"
"He lives in Ravenshore to this day."
msgstr ""
"Ulbrecht Pederton detuvo él solo la Segunda Guerra Pirata. Atacó la playa para acudir en defensa de Ravenshore cuando los piratas empezaron a llegar a tierra. Manipuló el propio mar y obligó a la flota regnan a volver al océano. Por desgracia, este esfuerzo le costó perder la capacidad de usar la magia. Sin embargo, sigue enseñando el conocimiento de la Magia del Agua en Experto. Actualmente reside en Ravenshore."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:151 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:461 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4668
msgid "Gregory Mist"
msgstr "Gregory Mist"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1125 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4669
msgid ""
"Gregory Mist, Master of Water, makes his home in the village of Rust in the Ironsand Desert.\n"
"He claims to have a plan to use his magic to change the hot desert into a verdant green plain.\n"
"If he has the time, he can teach you Mastery of Water Magic."
msgstr ""
"Gregory Mist, Maestro de Agua, ha establecido su hogar en la aldea de Herrumbre, en el Desierto de Arena de Hierro. Afirma tener un plan para convertir con su magia el tórrido desierto en un campo de intenso verdor. Si tiene tiempo, os puede enseñar la Maestría en la Magia del Agua."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:152 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:462 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4673
msgid "Black Current"
msgstr "Black Current"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1128 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4674
msgid ""
"Black Current was once a powerful mage in this region.\n"
"Her ambition for power outgrew her caution and she attempted to conquer the Plane of Water.\n"
"She summoned a gate to the plane and stepped through.\n"
"She was never heard from again.\n"
"She was the Grand Master of Water Magic.\n"
"If she still lives you may find her in the Plane of Water."
msgstr ""
"Black Current fue en otro tiempo una poderosa maga de esta región.\n"
"Su ambición de poder superó a su prudencia e intentó conquistar el Plano del Agua.\n"
"Invocó un portal a ese plano y lo atravesó.\n"
"Nunca más se supo de ella.\n"
"Era la Gran Maestra en Magia del Agua.\n"
"Si aún vive, quizá la encontréis en el Plano del Agua."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:156 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:463 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4678
msgid "Ostrin Grivic"
msgstr "Ostrin Grivic"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:135 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1134 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4679
msgid ""
"Ostrin Grivic, Expert instructor of Earth Magic, lives in the village of Blood Drop on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr ""
"Ostrin Grivic, instructor Experto en Magia de la Tierra, vive en el pueblo Gota de Sangre en las Islas de Herida de Daga"

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:157 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:464 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4683
msgid "Dorothy Sablewood"
msgstr "Dorothy Sablewood"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1135 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4684
msgid ""
"Earth Magic Master Dorothy Sablewood helped end the First Pirate War.\n"
"With the aid of an unknown Air Mage, she erected walls of clay to keep the Regnan Pirates from leaving their boats.\n"
"She now teaches her skills from her home in Alvar."
msgstr ""
"La Maestra en Magia de la Tierra Sablewood ayudó a terminar con la Primera Guerra Pirata. Con la ayuda de un Mago de Aire desconocido, levantó muros de arcilla para evitar que los piratas regnan bajaran de sus barcos. Ahora enseña sus conocimientos en su casa de Alvar."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:158 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:465 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4688
msgid "Griven"
msgstr "Griven"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1138 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4689
msgid ""
"Grand Master Griven passed into the Plane of Earth after teaching his final lesson to Dorothy Sablewood.\n"
"Perhaps he lives there to this day.\n"
"Who knows what transpires in an elemental plane?"
msgstr ""
"El Gran Maestro Griven pasó al Plano de la Tierra tras dar su última lección a Dorothy Sablewood.\n"
"Quizá siga viviendo allí.\n"
"¿Quién sabe lo que ocurre en un plano elemental?"

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:159 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:466 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4693
msgid "Straton Hawthorne"
msgstr "Straton Hawthorne"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:138 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1141 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4694
msgid ""
"Straton Hawthorne can raise you to Expert level in the arts of Spirit Magic. He makes his home in the port city of Ravenshore."
msgstr ""
"Straton Hawthorne os puede elevar a la categoría de Experto en las artes de la Magia del Espíritu. Vive en la ciudad portuaria de Ravenshore"

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:160 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:467 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4698
msgid "Bethold Kern"
msgstr "Bethold Kern"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1142 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4699
msgid ""
"Master Bethold Kern, serves the knight Charles Quixote in his crusade against the Dragons of the Garrote Gorge region.\n"
"Search him out there at the Dragon Hunter's Camp.\n"
"If you are lucky, he will have time to instruct you in Mastery of Spirit Magic."
msgstr ""
"El Maestro Bethold Kern sirve a las órdenes del caballero Charles Quijote en su cruzada contra los dragones de la región de Garrote Gorge. Buscadlo en el campamento de los cazadragones. Si tenéis suerte, él tendrá tiempo de instruiros en la Maestría de la Magia del Espíritu."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:161 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:468 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4703
msgid "Lasiter Ravensight"
msgstr "Lasiter Ravensight"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1145 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4704
msgid ""
"Lasiter Ravensight, is the Grand Master of Spirit Magic.\n"
"He lives in the Murmurwoods close to the Temple of the Sun, where he continues his studies in to the essence of Spirit.\n"
"He can raise your skill in Spirit Magic to Grand Mastery."
msgstr ""
"Lasiter Ravensight es el Gran Maestro de la Magia del Espíritu. Vive en Murmurwoods, cerca del Templo del Sol, donde continúa sus estudios en la esencia del espíritu. Puede elevar vuestra habilidad con la Magia del Espíritu hasta la Gran Maestría."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:162 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:469 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4708
msgid "Shane Krewlen"
msgstr "Shane Krewlen"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1148 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4709
msgid ""
"Shane Krewlen, student of Mind Magic, can instruct you in the Expert skills of this arcane magic.\n"
"Seek him out in the Dark Elf city of Alvar."
msgstr ""
"Shane Krewlen, alumno de la Magia de la Mente, os puede instruir en las habilidades de Experto de esta magia secreta. Buscadlo en la ciudad de elfos oscuros de Alvar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:470 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4713
msgid "Barthine Lotts"
msgstr "Barthine Lotts"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1150 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4714
msgid ""
"Barthine Lotts, Master of Mind Magic, dwells in the Minotaur city of Balthazar Lair in the Ravage Roaming region.\n"
"Through her instruction can gain Mastery of Mind Magic."
msgstr ""
"Barthine Lotts, Maestra de Magia de la Mente, vive en la ciudad de los minotauros de la Guarida de Baltasar, en la región de Ronda Siniestra. A través de sus enseñanzas, podréis alcanzar la Maestría en la Magia de la Mente."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:164 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:471 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4718
msgid "Gilad Dreamwright"
msgstr "Gilad Dreamwright"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1152 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4719
msgid ""
"Gilad Dreamwright, Grand Master of Mind Magic, has joined many other Grand Masters of Magic in the Murmurwoods region.\n"
"Here they work with the Temple of the Sun to further their combined skills and knowledge.\n"
"Gilad can instruct you to Grand Master skill level in Mind Magic."
msgstr ""
"Gilad Dreamwright, Gran Maestro de Magia de la Mente, se ha unido a muchos otros Grandes Maestros de Magia en la región del Murmurwoods. Allí trabajan con el Templo del Sol para mejorar sus habilidades y conocimientos combinados. Gilad puede instruiros en la habilidad de Gran Maestro en la Magia de la Mente."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:165 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:472 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4723
msgid "Zevah Poised"
msgstr "Zevah Poised"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1155 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4724
msgid ""
"Zevah Poised, Expert instructor of the arcane skills of Body Magic, lives with his people on the Islands of Dagger Wound in the Ifarine Sea."
msgstr ""
"Zevah Poised, instructor Experto de las habilidades secretas de la Magia del Cuerpo, vive con su pueblo en las Islas de Herida de Daga del Mar Ifarino."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:166 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:473 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4728
msgid "Tugor Arin"
msgstr "Tugor Arin"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1156 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4729
msgid ""
"Tugor Arin, Master of Body Magic, practices his healing skills in the service of the knight Charles Quixote in the Garrote Gorge region.\n"
"His skills in Body Magic are put to good use healing the unfortunate young knights who are wounded in the crusade against the Dragons of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr ""
"Tugor Arin, Maestro de Magia del Cuerpo, practica sus artes curativas al servicio del caballero Charles Quijote en la región de Garrote Gorge. Da buen uso de sus conocimientos de Magia del Cuerpo, curando a los caballeros que hayan tenido la desgracia de ser heridos en la cruzada contra los dragones de Garrote Gorge."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:167 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:474 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4733
msgid "Critias Snowtree"
msgstr "Critias Snowtree"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1158 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4734
msgid ""
"Grand Master Critias Snowtree, dwells in the peace of the Murmurwoods forest away from the trials and troubles of the world.\n"
"Only he can instruct you in the ways of Body Magic and raise you to Grand Mastery of this arcane skill."
msgstr ""
"El Gran Maestro Critias Snowtree vive en la paz de Murmurwoods, lejos del mundanal ruido. Sólo él puede instruiros en las artes de la Magia del Cuerpo y ascenderos a la Gran Maestría en esta habilidad secreta."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:168 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:475 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4738
msgid "Archibald Dawnsglow"
msgstr "Archibald Dawnsglow"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1160 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4739
msgid ""
"Archibald Dawnsglow, Expert instructor of Light Magic, practices his arts in the city of Ravenshore on the Ifarine Sea.\n"
"His parents gave his name not knowing that it was the same name as the leader of the Erathian Necromancers' Guild.\n"
"Archibald desires to have his own name made in the Light, not in the darkness of his namesake."
msgstr ""
"Archibald Dawnsglow, instructor Experto de Magia de la Luz, practica sus artes en la ciudad de Ravenshore, en el Mar Ifarino. Sus padres le pusieron el nombre sin saber que era el mismo que el del líder del Gremio de los nigromantes de Erathia. Archibald desea que su nombre se forje en la luz, no en la oscuridad como el de su tocayo."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1927 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:474
msgid ""
"Oh, what a mess you've made of things! When I asked you to find me a witness of events in the Ironsand Desert, I thought it would be obvious that you'd have to return him to me in good condition! I mean look at the poor Troll! Take him to the temple and get him fixed up.And please...try to remember you're working for the guild. We do have a reputation for conducting ourselves with at least passing competence."
msgstr ""
"¡Vaya lío os habéis hecho! Cuando os pedí que encontraseis un testigo de los hechos del Desierto de Arena de Hierro, pensé que era evidente que teníais que traerlo en buenas condiciones de salud. ¡Y mirad cómo está este pobre troll! Llevadlo al templo y que lo compongan."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:169 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:476 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4743
msgid "Lunius Dawnbringer"
msgstr "Lunius Dawnbringer"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1163 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4744
msgid ""
"Master Lunius Dawnbringer, dwells among the the Clerics of Murmurwoods.He can promote you to Master of Light Magic, if you can survive the dangers of the forest."
msgstr ""
"El Maestro Lunius Dawnbringer, vive entre los Clérigos de Murmurwoods. Os puede ascender a Maestro en la Magia de la Luz, si podéis sobrevivir a los peligros del bosque."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:170 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:477 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4748
msgid "Aldrin Cleareye"
msgstr "Aldrin Cleareye"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1164 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4749
msgid ""
"Aldrin Cleareye, Grand Master of the Light, makes his home on the island of Regna.\n"
"He hopes to bring an end to the Pirates evil ways.\n"
"He can instruct you to Grand Masterey, if you survive the Pirates."
msgstr ""
"Aldrin Cleareye, Gran Maestro de la Luz, vive en la isla de Regna. Espera poner fin a las malas artes de los Piratas. Os puede enseñar la Gran Maestría, si sobrevivís a los piratas."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:171 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:478 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4753
msgid "Patwin Darkenmore"
msgstr "Patwin Darkenmore"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4754
msgid ""
"Patwin Darkenmore, Expert teacher of the ways of Dark Magic, lives among the Dark Elves of Alvar.\n"
msgstr ""
"Patwin Darkenmore, profesor Experto en las artes de la Magia de la Oscuridad, vive entre los elfos oscuros de Alvar.\n"

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:172 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:479 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4758
msgid "Carla Umberpool"
msgstr "Carla Umberpool"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1169 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4759
msgid ""
"Dark Magic Master Carla Umberpool followed the travels of Sithicus Shadowrunner, Grand Master of the Dark, and makes her home with the Necromancers of Shadowspire."
msgstr ""
"La Maestra en Magia de la Oscuridad, Carla Umberpool siguió los viajes de Sithicus Corresombras, Gran Maestro de la Oscuridad, y vive con los nigromantes de Shadowspire."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:173 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:480 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4763
msgid "Sithicus Shadowrunner"
msgstr "Sithicus Shadowrunner"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1170 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4764
msgid ""
"Sithicus Shadowrunner, Grand Master of the art of Dark Magic, and has established a home on the Island of Regna.\n"
"Here the pirate captains get her blessing on the ships before a raid.\n"
"She can instruct you in Grand Mastery of Dark Magic."
msgstr ""
"Sithicus Shadowrunner, Gran Maestra de las artes de la Magia de la Oscuridad, se ha ido a vivir a la Isla de Regna. De ella, los capitanes piratas reciben la bendición de sus barcos antes de los ataques. Puede instruiros en la Gran Maestría con la Magia de la Oscuridad."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:201 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:481 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4768
msgid "Kyra Sparkmen"
msgstr "Kyra Sparkmen"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4769
msgid ""
"Kyra Sparkmen, Expert teacher of the Identify Item skill, lives in the city of Alvar.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kyra Sparkmen, profesora Experta en la habilidad de Identificar Objetos, vive en la ciudad de Alvar.\n"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:154 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:477
msgid ""
"Well, so it is true. Imagine…a lake of fire. But where is my eyewitness? I need to speak with someone who saw its formation. This is important…for reasons I'm unwilling to discuss with you now.Find me someone who saw the birth of the lake of fire! Try searching the Troll village, Rust."
msgstr ""
"Bien, así que es cierto. Imaginad... un lago de fuego. ¿Pero dónde está mi testigo ocular? Debo hablar con alguien que haya visto cómo se formó. Es importante... por razones que no pienso discutir con vos."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:202 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:482 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4773
msgid "Eithian"
msgstr "Eithian"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1175 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4774
msgid ""
"Eithian, Master instructor of the Identify Item skill, serves the Merchants of Alvar, and currently lives on the Dagger Wound Islands. Many travelers bring their prizes to Eithian for identification.\n"
"He may have to time to instruct you to Mastery of this skill if you travel to him."
msgstr ""
"Eithian, instructor Maestro en la habilidad de la Identificación, sirve a los mercaderes de Alvar, y vive actualmente en las Islas de Herida de Daga. Muchos viajeros traen sus recompensas a Eithian para identificarlas. Puede que tenga tiempo para enseñaros la Maestría de esta habilidad si acudís a él."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:203 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:483 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4778
msgid "Elzbet Roggen"
msgstr "Elzbet Roggen"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1177 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4779
msgid ""
"Elzbet Roggen, Grand Master of the Identify Item skill, lives in the Shadowspire city of Twilight.\n"
"She can teach you what is needed to achieve Grand Mastery."
msgstr ""
"Elzbet Roggen, Gran Maestra en la habilidad de la Identificación, vive en la ciudad de Crepúsculo, en Shadowspire. Os puede enseñar lo necesario para alcanzar la Gran Maestría."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:189 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:484 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4783
msgid "Fishner Thomb"
msgstr "Fishner Thomb"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1179 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4784
msgid ""
"Fishner Thomb, retired from service with the Merchants of Alvar and returned to his home Island of Dagger Wound in the Ifarine Sea.\n"
"Seek him out there for his teachings in the Expert way of being a Merchant."
msgstr ""
"Fishner Thomb se retiró con los mercaderes de Alvar y volvió a su tierra natal de las Islas de Herida de Daga en el Mar Ifarino. Buscadlo allí para recibir sus enseñanzas de Experto sobre cómo ser un Mercader."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:190 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:485 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4788
msgid "Fenton Iverson"
msgstr "Fenton Iverson"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1181 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4789
msgid ""
"Fenton Iverson, Master Merchant of Alvar, tests all who wish to advanced with the skills of a Merchant.\n"
"You will find Fenton in the merchant city of Alvar, where he can instruct you to Mastery of the Merchant skill."
msgstr ""
"Fenton Iverson, Mercader Maestro de Alvar, pone a prueba a los que desean avanzar en la habilidad de mercader. Encontraréis a Fenton en la ciudad mercader de Alvar, donde puede instruiros en la Maestría con la habilidad de Mercader."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:153 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:479
msgid ""
"I must know more about what is going on in the Ironsand Desert. I can't use more rumors. I have enough of those already.I need you to actually go there. The desert is several days travel to the east."
msgstr ""
"Debo saber más sobre lo que está pasando en el Desierto De Arena de Hierro. Ya no me sirven los rumores. Ya he oído suficientes."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:191 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:486 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4793
msgid "Raven Quicktoungue"
msgstr "Raven Quicktoungue"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1183 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4794
msgid ""
"Raven Quicktoungue, Grand Master Merchant of Alvar, dwells in the city of Ravenshore.\n"
"There, Raven can watch the interaction of numerous races as the trade with each other.\n"
"Only he can raise your knowledge to Grand Mastery of the merchant skill."
msgstr ""
"Raven Quicktoungue, Mercader Gran Maestro de Alvar, reside en la ciudad de Ravenshore. Allí, Raven puede observar cómo comercian entre sí numerosas razas. Sólo él puede elevar vuestro conocimiento de la habilidad de Mercader a la Gran Maestría."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:204 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:487 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4798
msgid "Evandar Lotts"
msgstr "Evandar Lotts"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1186 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4799
msgid ""
"Evandar Lotts teaches the Expert skills of Repairing Items.\n"
"He dwells in the seaside city of Ravenshore."
msgstr ""
"Evandar Lotts enseña la habilidad de Reparar Objetos a nivel Experto.\n"
"Vive en la ciudad costera de Ravenshore."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1386 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:48
msgid ""
"Sadly, the caravan was one of the first things the pirates looted in their raids. I have no idea what they're going to do with three-hundred cases of tobersk fruit! Naturally, I miss the fruit, but the worst of it is the damage they did to the carts. It looks like I'll be here for at least the next season overseeing their repair. I just hope the task is done before the next tobersk harvest so I can see some return out of this profitless venture."
msgstr ""
"Por desgracia, la caravana fue una de las primeras cosas que saquearon los piratas en sus ataques. No me imagino qué van a hacer con trescientas cajas de fruta toberska. Como es natural, siento haber perdido la fruta, pero lo peor es el daño que les han hecho a los carros. Parece que me tendré que quedar aquí hasta la próxima temporada supervisando su reparación. Sólo espero que la tarea esté terminada para la próxima cosecha de toberska para poder recuperarme algo de esta aventura tan poco lucrativa."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:205 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:488 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4803
msgid "Quick Jeni"
msgstr "Quick Jeni"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1188 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4804
msgid ""
"Quick Jeni, is the Master of the Repair Item skill. She lives in the village around the Dargon Hunter's Fort in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr ""
"Quick Jeni es Maestra en la habilidad de Reparación. Vive en la aldea que hay en los alrededores del fuerte de los cazadragones, en Garrote Gorge."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:489 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4808
msgid "Quethrin Tonk"
msgstr "Quethrin Tonk"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1189 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4809
msgid ""
"Quethrin Tonk, Grand Master of the Repair Item skill, dwells in the tranquil Murmurwoods.\n"
"His skills have proven invaluable to the Temple of the Sun."
msgstr ""
"Quethrin Tonk, Gran Maestro en la habilidad de Reparación, vive en el tranquilo Murmurwoods. Sus habilidades han demostrado tener un valor incalculable para el Templo del Sol."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:198 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:490 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4813
msgid "Menasaur"
msgstr "Menasaur"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4814
msgid ""
"Menasaur, the strongest Lizardmen on the Dagger Wound Islands, is the Expert instructor of the Body Building skill. "
msgstr ""
"Menasaur, el hombre-lagarto más fuerte de las Islas de Herida de Daga, es el instructor Experto de la habilidad de Culturismo. "

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:199 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:491 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4818
msgid "Kenneth Otterton"
msgstr "Kenneth Otterton"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1192 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4819
msgid ""
"Kenneth Otterton, holds the title of Crusader, and serves under the knight Charles Quixote in Garrote Gorge.\n"
"Rumor has it that he wrestled a Dragon to the ground single-handedly.\n"
"Of course, other knights had to assist in the kill.\n"
"Kenneth also holds the title, Master Instructor of Body Building."
msgstr ""
"Kenneth Otterton posee el título de cruzado y sirve a las órdenes del caballero Charles Quijote en Garrote Gorge. Se rumorea que abatió un dragón con una sola mano. Por supuesto, otros caballeros tuvieron que ayudarle para matarlo. Kenneth también tiene el título de instructor Maestro de Culturismo."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:200 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:492 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4823
msgid "Mikel Smithson"
msgstr "Mikel Smithson"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1196 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4824
msgid ""
"Mikel Smithson, holds the title of Strongest in Jadame.\n"
"He is also the Grand Master of the Body Building skill.\n"
"Seek him out in the village of Rust in the Ironsand Desert if you wish to perfect the strength of your bodies."
msgstr ""
"Mikel Smithson tiene el título de El hombre más fuerte de Jadame. También es el Gran Maestro de la habilidad de Culturismo. Buscadlo en la aldea de Herrumbre en el Desierto de Arena de Hierro si deseáis perfeccionar la fuerza de vuestros cuerpos."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:195 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:493 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4828
msgid "Alton Putnam"
msgstr "Alton Putnam"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1199 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4829
msgid ""
"Alton Putnam, is an Expert in the art of Meditation.\n"
"He can instruct you if you seek him out in the seaside city of Ravenshore."
msgstr ""
"Alton Putnam es un Experto en el arte de la Meditación. Puede instruiros si lo buscáis en la ciudad costera de Ravenshore."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:196 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:494 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4833
msgid "Gretchin Nevermore"
msgstr "Gretchin Nevermore"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1201 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4834
msgid ""
"Gretchin Nevermore, instructs all Clerics of the Sun the Master arts of Meditation. He dwells in the Murmurwoods near the Temple of the Sun."
msgstr ""
"Gretchin Nevermore, instruye a todos los clérigos del Templo del Sol en las artes de nivel de Maestro de Meditación. Vive en Murmurwoods, cerca del Templo del Sol."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:197 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:495 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4838
msgid "Lenord Nightcrawler"
msgstr "Lenord Nightcrawler"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1202 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4839
msgid ""
"Lenord Nightcrawler, Grand Master of Meditation, serves as one of the foremost members of the Necromancers' Guild of Shadowspire.\n"
"He instructs all necromancers in the art of Meditation from his home in the village of Twilight."
msgstr ""
"Lenord Nightcrawler, Gran Maestro de Meditación, sirve como uno de los miembros más relevantes del Gremio de los nigromantes de Shadowspire. Instruye a todos los nigromantes en el arte de la Meditación en su casa de la aldea de Crepúsculo."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:186 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:496 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4843
msgid "Silk Nightwalker"
msgstr "Silk Nightwalker"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1204 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4844
msgid ""
"Silk Nightwalker, Expert teacher of the Perception skill, makes his home in the Dark Elf city of Alvar.\n"
"Instructing the Merchants of Alvar in the skills needed to detect that which is supposed to remain secret occupies most of his time, however him may take the time to instruct you if luck is with you."
msgstr ""
"Silk Nightwalker, profesor Experto en la habilidad de la Percepción, vive en la ciudad de elfos oscuros de Alvar. Ocupa la mayor parte del tiempo enseñando a los mercaderes de Alvar en las habilidades necesarias para detectar lo que se supone que es secreto; sin embargo, puede que se ocupe de instruiros si tenéis suerte."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:187 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:497 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4848
msgid "Helga Steeleye"
msgstr "Helga Steeleye"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1206 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4849
msgid ""
"Helga Steeleye, lives among the necromancers of Shadowspire in the village of Twilight.\n"
"The Necromancers' Guild is thankful for her Master level instructions in the skill of Perception."
msgstr ""
"Helga Steeleye vive con los nigromantes de Shadowspire en la aldea de Crepúsculo. El Gremio de los nigromantes agradece su enseñanzas de nivel de Maestro en la habilidad de la Percepción."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:188 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:498 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4853
msgid "Balan Suretrail"
msgstr "Balan Suretrail"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1208 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4854
msgid ""
"Grand Master Balan Suretrail lives in the Minotaur city of Balthazar Lair.\n"
"To gain his instruction in the skill of Perception, you must seek him out in Ravage Roaming."
msgstr ""
"El Gran Maestro Balan Suretrail vive en la ciudad de los minotauros, en la Guarida de Baltasar. Para obtener su instrucción en la habilidad de la Percepción, debéis buscarlo en Ronda Siniestra."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:216 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:499 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4858
msgid "Kethric Tarent"
msgstr "Kethric Tarent"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1210 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4859
msgid ""
"Kethric Tarent, teaches the Expert knowledge of Regeneration from his home in the Ironsand Desert, in the village of Rust."
msgstr ""
"Kethric Tarent enseña el conocimiento de Experto en Regeneración en su casa del Desierto de Arena de Hierro, en la aldea de Herrumbre."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:217 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:500 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4863
msgid "William Sampson"
msgstr "William Sampson"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1211 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4864
msgid ""
"William Sampson, Master of Regeneration, lives in the peace of the Murmurwoods.\n"
"He uses the libraries of the Temple of the Sun to further his knowledge of Trollish history."
msgstr ""
"William Sampson, Maestro de Regeneración, vive en la paz de Murmurwoods. Utiliza las bibliotecas del Templo del Sol para ampliar sus conocimientos de historia troll."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:218 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:501 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4868
msgid "Ush the Many Tailed"
msgstr "Ush Muchas Colas"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1213 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4869
msgid ""
"Ush the Many Tailed, Grand Master of Regeneration and legendary warrior, lives among his people on Dagger Wound Island.\n"
"Legends say he has lost his tail thirteen times in battle against the Regnan Pirates, and each time he has grown a new tail!"
msgstr ""
"Ush Muchas Colas, Gran Maestro de Regeneración y guerrero legendario, vive con su pueblo en las Islas de Herida de Daga. Cuentas las leyendas que ha perdido su cola trece veces luchando contra los piratas regnan, y siempre le ha crecido una nueva."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1919 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:487 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:494
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:506 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:513
msgid ""
"Very good…or at least, as good as can be expected. You managed to bring three partners into the alliance--the minimum number my advisors told me would be sufficient to fulfill the \"…Jadame, must stand together…\" part of the prophecy. A pity it could not be more, but events of the cataclysm are clearly coming to a head. It is time to move onward.You must travel to Ravenshore and meet with the alliance council gathered there. With them, decide what must be the next step we take in meeting the elemental crisis."
msgstr ""
"Muy bien..., al menos lo bien que se podía esperar. Habéis conseguido tres socios para la alianza, el número mínimo que mis consejeros me dijeron que bastaría para cubrir la parte \"... Jadame debe estar unida...\" de la profecía. Una lástima que no hayan podido ser más, pero los eventos del cataclismo están alcanzando un punto muy crítico. Ha llegado el momento de actuar."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:183 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:502 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4873
msgid "Chevon Wist"
msgstr "Chevon Wist"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1215 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4874
msgid ""
"Chevon Wist, teaches the Expert knowledge of the Disarm Trap skill, which has proven useful to those who explore the ruined temples near his home on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr ""
"Chevon Wist enseña el conocimiento de Experto de la habilidad Desarmar Trampas, que ha demostrado ser útil a los que exploran los templos arruinados cercanos a su hogar en las Islas de Herida de Daga."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:184 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:503 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4878
msgid "Kelli Lightfingers"
msgstr "Kelli Lightfingers"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1216 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4879
msgid ""
"Kelli Lightfingers, Master of Disarming Traps, has retired to her home in the merchant city of Alvar.\n"
"There she still teaches young merchants the skills of trapping and disarming chests.\n"
"If you are worthy she can raise your Disarm Trap skills to that of a Master."
msgstr ""
"Kelli Lightfingers, Maestra Desarmar Trampas, se ha retirado a su casa en la ciudad mercante de Alvar. Allí sigue enseñando a los jóvenes mercaderes las habilidades de poner y quitar trampas a los cofres. Si lo merecéis, puede elevar vuestros conocimientos en Desarmar Trampas al nivel de Maestro."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:185 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:504 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4883
msgid "Gareth Lifter"
msgstr "Gareth Lifter"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1219 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4884
msgid ""
"Gareth Lifter, Grand Master of Disarming Traps, lives on the opulent island of Regna, where he teaches his fellow pirates in the best way to trap their chests of stolen booty."
msgstr ""
"Gareth Lifter, Gran Maestro en Desarmar Trampas, vive en la opulenta isla de Regna, donde enseña a los demás piratas la mejor forma de poner trampas a sus botines."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4310 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4892 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4897
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4902 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4907 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4912
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4917
msgid ""
"Here's your weapon; if you find more ore, I'll be happy to make you more weapons."
msgstr "Aquí está el arma. Si encontráis más mineral, os podré fabricar otra."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:155 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:490 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:497
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:500 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:509 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:516
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:519 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:523
msgid ""
"You must form an alliance to stand against our threatened oblivion! Seek support from the Necromancers' Guild, Temple of the Sun, Minotaurs of Ravage Roaming, Dragons of Garrote Gorge, and the Dragon hunting party of Charles Quixote in Garrote Gorge. I'm sure that you will find it impossible to get all of them to agree to work together, but still, you must make your best effort.If we are to survive in this time of prophecy, my sages tell me that at least three of the groups I mentioned must agree to work together. Go and do this thing. If you value this world and your lives, go!"
msgstr ""
"¡Debéis crear una alianza para luchar contra la amenaza de nuestro olvido! Buscad apoyo en el Gremio de los nigromantes, en el Templo del Sol, entre los minotauros de Ronda Siniestra, entre los dragones de Garrote Gorge, entre los cazadores de dragones de Charles Quijote en Garrote Gorge. Estoy convencido de que os resultará imposible conseguir que estén de acuerdo en trabajar todos juntos, pero aun así, debéis intentarlo con todas vuestras fuerzas."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1286 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4311 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4919
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6020
msgid ""
"You need ore for me to create weapons.\n"
"The better the ore, the better the weapon I can make."
msgstr ""
"Necesito mineral para fabricaros armas. Cuanto mejor sea el mineral, mejor será la calidad del arma."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4313 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4927 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4932
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4937 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4942 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4947
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4952
msgid ""
"Here's your armor; if you find more ore, I'll be happy to make you more armor."
msgstr ""
"Aquí está la armadura. Si encontráis más mineral, os podré fabricar otra."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1289 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4314 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4954
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6055
msgid ""
"You need ore for me to create armor.\n"
"The better the ore, the better the armor I can make."
msgstr ""
"Necesito mineral para fabricaros armaduras. Cuanto mejor sea el mineral, mejor será la calidad de la armadura."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4316 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4962 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4967
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4972 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4977 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4982
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4987
msgid ""
"Here is your item; if you find more ore, I'll be happy to make you more items."
msgstr ""
"Aquí está el objeto. Si encontráis más mineral, os podré fabricar otro."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1292 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4317 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4989
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:6090
msgid ""
"You need ore for me to create items.\n"
"The better the ore, the better the items I can make."
msgstr ""
"Necesito mineral para fabricaros objetos. Cuanto mejor sea el mineral, mejor será la calidad del objeto."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4319 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4994
msgid ""
"The signal rocket on the west side of the island should be set of to warn ships off from approaching to close to that side of the island.\n"
"The reefs off the west coast have proven deadly in the past."
msgstr ""
"Hay que disparar el cohete de señales de la parte occidental de la isla para advertir a los barcos de que no se acerquen demasiado a ese lado de la isla.\n"
"Los arrecifes de la costa oeste han resultado mortales en el pasado."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:4998
msgid ""
"Beware the marshes of the southern tip of the island.\n"
"The dragon flies that pester our town spawn there!\n"
msgstr ""
"Cuidado con las marismas del extremo sur de la isla.\n"
"¡Allí se crían las Libélulas que acosan a nuestro pueblo!\n"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4324 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5002
msgid ""
"Fallen or dead trees can sometimes be the hiding place of some treasure or trinket.\n"
"However, it can also be home to insects or worse!"
msgstr ""
"Los troncos de árbol pueden esconder algún tipo de tesoro... O ser el hogar de insectos o de alguna otra criatura."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:207 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:511 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5005
msgid "Tessa Maker"
msgstr "Tessa Maker"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1226 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5006
msgid ""
"Tessa Maker, Expert in Monster Identification, seeks to improve her skills by cataloging the different Dragons of Garrote Gorge.\n"
"She is currently in the service of the knight, Charles Quixote."
msgstr ""
"Tessa Maker, Experta en Reconocimiento, pretende mejorar su habilidad catalogando los dragones de Garrote Gorge. Actualmente está a las órdenes del caballero Charles Quijote."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:208 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:512 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5010
msgid "Matric Keenedge"
msgstr "Matric Keenedge"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1228 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5011
msgid ""
"Matric Keenedge, Master of the skill of Identify Monster, is currently studying the creatures of the Murmurwoods.\n"
"If you seek Mastery of this skill you need to seek him out there."
msgstr ""
"Matric Keenedge, Maestro en la habilidad de Reconocimiento, se encuentra actualmente en Murmurwoods estudiando sus criaturas. Si buscáis la Maestría en esta habilidad, debéis buscarlo allí."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:209 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:513 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5015
msgid "Blacken Stonecleaver"
msgstr "Blacken Stonecleaver"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1230 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5016
msgid ""
"Blacken Stonecleaver, Grand Master of Monster Identification, has seen every creature on the continent of Jadame.\n"
"He can teach you his knowledge if you find his home in the city of Ravenshore."
msgstr ""
"Blacken Stonecleaver, Gran Maestro de Reconocimiento, ha visto todas las criaturas del continente de Jadame. Puede enseñaros sus conocimientos si encontráis su casa en la ciudad de Ravenshore."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:210 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:514 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5020
msgid "Norbert Slayer"
msgstr "Norbert Slayer"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1232 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5021
msgid ""
"Knight Norbert Slayer, instructs all of Charles Quixote's knights in the Expert forms of\n"
"Armsmastery.\n"
"If you travel to Garrote Gorge, you can attend one of his teachings."
msgstr ""
"El caballero Norbert Slayer, instruye a todos los caballeros de Charles Quijote en las artes de Experto en Maestro Armero. Si viajáis a Garrote Gorge, podréis recibir sus enseñanzas."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:211 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:515 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5025
msgid "Lasatin the Scarred"
msgstr "Lasatin Cara Cortada"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1235 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5026
msgid ""
"Lasatin the Scarred, Master of the Armsmaster skill, lives on the Islands of Dagger Wound."
msgstr ""
"Lasatin Cara Cortada, Maestro de la habilidad de Maestro Armero vive en las Islas de Herida de Daga."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:212 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:516 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5030
msgid "Jasper Steelcoif"
msgstr "Jasper Steelcoif"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1236 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5031
msgid ""
"Jasper Steelcoif, Grand Master of the Armsmaster skill, is one of the leaders of the Regnan Pirate Council.\n"
"He instructs all pirates in the use of weapons.\n"
"If you are brave enough to travel to Regna--and survive his instruction--you too, will have Grand Mastery of this skill."
msgstr ""
"Jasper Steelcoif, Gran Maestro de la habilidad de Maestro Armero, es uno de los líderes del Consejo pirata de Regna. Adiestra a todos los piratas en el uso de las armas. Si tenéis el valor de viajar a Regna (y de sobrevivir a sus clases), os convertiréis también en Gran Maestro en esta habilidad."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4423 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5037
msgid ""
"I can see your heart is in the right place, but your purse obviously isn't.\n"
"If you don't have the money, just say so.\n"
"In any event, good luck dealing with the zombies.\n"
"Ta-ta!"
msgstr ""
"Vuestro corazón está en el sitio adecuado, no así vuestra bolsa. Si no tenéis dinero, decidlo. Buena suerte con los Zombies."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4382 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5042
msgid ""
"This 1000 gold will go a long way to keeping zombies off the roads.\n"
"Thank you for your contribution."
msgstr ""
"Estas 1000 monedas de oro ayudarán mucho a mantener a los zombis alejados de los caminos.\n"
"Gracias por vuestra contribución."

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4384 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5053
msgid ""
"That's a shame.\n"
"What a coincidence, I think I see some zombies on the roads.\n"
"Perhaps next time you'll be more inclined to contribute."
msgstr ""
"Lástima... Vaya, me parece ver unos Zombies en la lejanía. Quizás la próxima vez prefiráis colaborar."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:4387 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5059
msgid ""
"Excellent!\n"
"Here is a crate of Arrowheads.\n"
"Pip Hillier in Erathia pays the best prices for these. Be sure to see him!"
msgstr ""
"¡Excelente!\n"
"Aquí tenéis una caja de Puntas de Flecha.\n"
"Pip Hillier, en Erathia, es quien mejor paga por ellas. ¡No dejéis de ir a verlo!"

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:213 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:520 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5090
msgid "Tabitha Watershed"
msgstr "Tabitha Watershed"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1242 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5091
msgid ""
"Tabitha Watershed, Expert Alchemist, teaches the skills of potions and poultices from her home in the merchant city of Alvar."
msgstr ""
"Tabitha Watershed, Alquimista Experta, enseña las artes de las pociones y cataplasmas en su casa de la ciudad mercante de Alvar."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:214 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:521 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5095
msgid "Kethry Treasurestone"
msgstr "Kethry Treasurestone"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1243 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5096
msgid ""
"Kethry Treasurestone, Master Alchemist, lives in the Murmurwoods, studying plants and mushrooms that grow in that peaceful forest."
msgstr ""
"Kethry Treasurestone, Alquimista Maestra, vive en Murmurwoods, estudiando las plantas y setas que crecen en ese tranquilo bosque."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:215 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:522 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5100
msgid "Ich"
msgstr "Ich"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1244 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5101
msgid ""
"Ich, Grand Master of Alchemy, has studied the art of brewing for decades.\n"
"He knows all there is to know about blending reagents into beneficial and harmful potions.\n"
"Seek out his home in the lush jungles of the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr ""
"Ich, Gran Maestro en Alquimia, lleva décadas estudiando el arte de preparar pociones. Sabe todo lo que hay que saber sobre la mezcla de reactivos en pociones benéficas o maléficas. Buscadlo en su casa de las selvas exuberantes de las Islas de Herida de Daga."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:192 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:523 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5105
msgid "Petra Mithrit"
msgstr "Petra Mithrit"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1247 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5106
msgid ""
"Petra Mithrit, Expert in the skill of Learning, dwells near the Temple of the Sun in the Murmurwoods."
msgstr ""
"Petra Mithrit, Experta en la habilidad del Aprendizaje, vive cerca del Templo del Sol en Murmurwoods."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:193 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:524 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5110
msgid "Garret Mistspring"
msgstr "Garret Mistspring"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1248 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5111
msgid ""
"Garret Mistspring, Master of Learning, instructs all students of necromancy in the art of Learning.\n"
"For this the Necromancers' Guild rewards him well.\n"
"His home is in the hamlet of Twilight at the base of the Shadowspire."
msgstr ""
"Garret Mistspring, Maestro en el Aprendizaje, enseña a todos los alumnos de nigromancia el arte del Aprendizaje. Y por ello, el Gremio de los nigromantes le recompensa generosamente. Tiene su hogar en la villa de Crepúsculo, en la base de Shadowspire."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:194 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:525 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5115
msgid "Wanda Lightsworn"
msgstr "Wanda Lightsworn"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1251 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5116
msgid ""
"Wanda Lightsworn, Grand Master of Learning, is in the hire of Charles Quixote, and instructs all of his knights in the skills of Learning.\n"
"It is the hope of Charles Quixote that this will give his forces and edge in battle against the Dragons of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr ""
"Wanda Lightsworn, Gran Maestra en el Aprendizaje, está al servicio de Charles Quijote y adiestra a todos sus caballeros en la habilidad del Aprendizaje. Charles Quijote tiene la esperanza de que esto dé a los suyos fuerzas y precisión en la batalla contra los dragones de Garrote Gorge."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:174 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:526 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5120
msgid "Flynn Shador"
msgstr "Flynn Shador"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1253 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5121
msgid ""
"Flynn Shador, Expert Vampire, lives in the city of Twilight, serving as eyes and a safe house for any Vampires that travel to that region.\n"
"He can instruct you in the Expert abilities of a Vampire."
msgstr ""
"Flynn Shador, Vampiro Experto, vive en la ciudad de Crepúsculo, custodiando y dando posada a todos los vampiros que viajan a esa región. Os puede instruir en las habilidades de Vampiro Experto."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:175 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:527 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5125
msgid "Douglas Dirthmoore"
msgstr "Douglas Dirthmoore"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1255 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5126
msgid ""
"Douglas Dirthmoore, Master Vampire, will teach any whose skills measure up to his standards.\n"
"Once he is done with you, you will have Mastered the abilities native to all Vampires.\n"
"His home is in the Shadowspire village of Twilight."
msgstr ""
"Douglas Dirthmoore, Vampiro Maestro, enseñará a todos los que tengan una habilidad que alcance sus exigencias. Cuando hayáis terminado, tendréis un nivel de Maestro en las habilidades innatas de los Vampiros. Vive en el pueblo de Crepúsculo, en Shadowspire."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:176 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:528 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5130
msgid "Payge Arachnia"
msgstr "Payge Arachnia"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1258 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5131
msgid ""
"Though no one knows for sure, Payge Arachnia, Grand Master Vampire, is rumored to be the first Vampire on the continent of Jadame. She knows all there is to be known about living as a Vampire and can teach you the Grand Master abilities she possesses.\n"
"Seek out her lair in Shadowspire."
msgstr ""
"Aunque nadie lo sabe de cierto, se rumorea que Payge Arachnia, Gran Maestra Vampiro, es la primera vampiro del continente de Jadame. Sabe todo lo que se debe saber sobre vivir como un Vampiro y os puede enseñar las habilidades de Gran Maestra que ella posee. Buscadla en Shadowspire."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:177 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:529 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5135
msgid "Fedwin Dervish"
msgstr "Fedwin Dervish"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1260 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5136
msgid ""
"Fedwin Dervish, can instruct you in the Expert ways of the Dark Elf.\n"
"Once you have learned from him, you will have begun a great journey to becoming a leader of your people.\n"
"Search him out in the Dark Elf city of Alvar."
msgstr ""
"Fedwin Dervish os puede instruir en las artes de Experto de los Elfos Oscuros. Cuando terminéis de aprender de él, habréis empezado el gran viaje que os llevará a convertiros en un líder para los vuestros. Buscadlo en la ciudad de elfos oscuros de Alvar."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:178 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:530 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5140
msgid "Lanshee Caverhill"
msgstr "Lanshee Caverhill"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1263 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5141
msgid ""
"Lanshee Caverhill, Master Merchant of Alvar currently lives in the seaside port of Ravenshore.\n"
"She knows all about Mastering the natural abilities all Dark Elves have."
msgstr ""
"Lanshee Caverhill, mercader Maestra de Alvar, vive actualmente en la ciudad portuaria de Ravenshore. Conoce todas las habilidades naturales de nivel de Maestro que poseen los Elfos Oscuros."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:179 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:531 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5145
msgid "Ton Agraynel"
msgstr "Ton Agraynel"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1265 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5146
msgid ""
"Ton Agraynel, Master Merchant of Alvar, can instruct you in the Grand Master skills of a Dark Elf.\n"
"You will have to prove yourself worthy of his instruction, but the benefits are well worth the effort."
msgstr ""
"Ton Agraynel, mercader Maestro de Alvar, puede instruiros en las habilidades de Gran Maestro de un Elfo Oscuro. Tendréis que demostrar que merecéis sus enseñanzas, pero los beneficios que obtendréis harán que merezca la pena el esfuerzo."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:180 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:532 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5150
msgid "Ishton"
msgstr "Ishton"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1267 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5151
msgid ""
"Ishton, Junior Flight Leader of the Dragons of Garrote Gorge, instructs all young Dragons to an Expert skill level with their racial Dragon abilities.\n"
"He dwells here, in the Dragon Caves of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr ""
"Ishton, instructor de vuelo de los Dragones de Garrote Gorge, adiestra a todos los Dragones jóvenes en el nivel de habilidad de Experto en las habilidades de su raza. Vive aquí, en las Cuevas de los dragones de Garrote Gorge."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:181 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:533 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5155
msgid "Erthint"
msgstr "Erthint"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1269 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5156
msgid ""
"Master Dragon Erthint is the Flight Leader of all of the Dragons that serve under Deftclaw Redreaver, and can instruct a Dragon in Mastery of his natural Dragon abilities. Erthint lives in the Dragon Caves of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr ""
"El Dragón Maestro Erthint es el instructor superior de vuelo de todos los Dragones que están a las órdenes de Deftclaw Redreaver, y puede instruir a un Dragón en el nivel de Maestro en sus habilidades naturales de Dragón. Erthint vive en las Cuevas de los Dragones de Garrote Gorge."

# kept in English: a proper name, as the language's MMMerge translation keeps it
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc.txt:182 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:534 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5160
msgid "Klain Scarwing"
msgstr "Klain Scarwing"

# imported from SP (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1270 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:5161
msgid ""
"Klain Scarwing, is second in strength only to Deftclaw Redreaver himself.\n"
"Klain holds the title of Grand Master Dragon and instructs all Dragons in the use of their natural abilities.\n"
"See him if you wish to attain Grand Master status.\n"
"He dwells here in the Dragon Caves of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr ""
"Klain Scarwing es el segundo más fuerte, sólo superado por el propio Deftclaw Redreaver. Klain tiene el título de Dragón Gran Maestro e instruye a todos los Dragones en el uso de sus habilidades naturales. Buscadlo si deseáis alcanzar el nivel de Gran Maestro. Vive aquí, en las Cuevas de los Dragones de Garrote Gorge."

