msgstr "Diadema Druida"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:376
msgid ""
"The circlet is in safe hands. The Temple of the Sun will not forget your help."
msgstr ""
"La diadema está en buenas manos. El Templo del Sol no olvidará vuestra ayuda."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:380
msgid ""
"The pilgrims bound for the Druid Circle were seeking more than old stones. It is said the druids of the Ancients left a relic there, the Druid Circlet of Power. The Temple of the Sun wishes to keep it safe before it falls into the wrong hands. The Circle lies to the northeast of here. If you find the circlet, bring it to me, and the Temple will reward you."
msgstr ""
"Los peregrinos que se dirigían al Círculo Druida buscaban algo más que piedras viejas. Se dice que los druidas de los Antiguos dejaron allí una reliquia, la Diadema Druida de Poder. El Templo del Sol desea ponerla a salvo antes de que caiga en malas manos. El Círculo se encuentra al nordeste de aquí. Si encontráis la diadema, traédmela y el Templo os recompensará."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/events/Global_maw.lua:393
msgid ""
"The Druid Circlet of Power! How many pilgrims gave their lives just to set eyes on it... The Temple of the Sun will keep it safe. Accept the Temple's gratitude, and this amulet."
msgstr ""
"¡La Diadema Druida de Poder! Cuántos peregrinos dieron la vida solo por contemplarla... El Templo del Sol la mantendrá a salvo. Aceptad la gratitud del Templo, y este amuleto."

